    <!--
      Privacy copy. This wording is deliberate and must not be strengthened.

      There are no ads. It is still not true that "nothing leaves this device": redeeming an
      inspection pass sends a code and a salted device hash to the licence server, so the absolute
      claim would be a lie the first time somebody typed a code. Say the narrower thing that is
      actually true and is what a buyer cares about — the measurements themselves never leave.
    -->
    <string name="privacy_tagline">Your test results stay on this device</string>
